OL,3,GNEWSAGST opponents admit P&R has the
OL,4,Avotes to succeed
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpponents of a tax package have
OL,7,Fadmitted defeat ahead of a final vote
OL,8,Fin the States of Guernsey that could
OL,9,Fcome as early as this evening.
OL,11,FPolicy and Resources' (P&R) plans
OL,12,Finvolve a 3% GST, lower income tax
OL,13,Frates, social security contribution
OL,14,Fallowances, the re-introduction of
OL,15,Fmotor tax, higher taxes on companies,
OL,16,Fhigher income tax allowances and
OL,17,Fgovernment savings.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
