OL,3,GNEWSAGST opponents admit P&R has the
OL,4,Avotes to succeed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Garry Collins, who has led a
OL,7,Fnumber of proposals to change the
OL,8,Fpackage, said: "We can clearly see a
OL,9,Fmajority in support of pushing through
OL,10,Fthis package."
OL,12,FAlderney Representative Edward Hill
OL,13,Ftold the States it looks like there
OL,14,Fwill be a GST and this would be "a huge
OL,15,Fblow for Alderney".
